  "content": "<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EHOCKO5PQA0?si=rn-7Wo9JYHF6OeSx\" width=\"860\" height=\"515\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>Immersive Damage Indicators（沉浸式伤害指示器）会在你伤害生物时显示漂浮的动画文字，支持使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-messages-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Messages API</a> 进行自定义字体、动画和颜色效果。</p>\n<p>本模组是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmm-indicators\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mmm Indicators</a> 的一个更新版多加载器分支，其渲染系统已通过 Immersive Messages 完全替换，以支持自定义效果和动画。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1255453/description_de7bc381-5299-43bd-8112-ba5ca9ec1247.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna%20Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ImmersiveDamageIndicators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1255453/description_633a8279-1d3a-4ed7-a349-3783b1317447.png\"></p>\n<p>如果你想要使用自定义字体，你需要安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaxton\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caxton</a>。但是，在启用 Iris 着色器时自定义字体将无法工作，此时本模组会自动默认回退到使用原版文本渲染器。</p>\n<p>如果安装了 Caxton，本模组将默认使用 Anton 字体，你可以在配置文件中更改此设置或将其留空以禁用：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1255453/description_1e0496b4-acd7-4daf-a574-ed4261ad49b3.png\"></p>\n<p>你还可以设置自定义颜色，将受伤时的红色更改为其他颜色，并单独切换每个效果的开关。</p>\n<p>如果你是开发者，还可以使用提供的 API 事件来完全访问粒子实例和 ImmersiveMessage 对象，以实现自定义样式：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1255453/description_b237606e-6533-4636-a305-bc78a1dc29cf.png\"></p>",
